2026-05-06T20:56:07.4772244Z  > {"github_actor":"tonistiigi","github_actor_id":"585223","github_event_name":"push","github_event_payload":{"after":"6baf355a08f32b7a13b2cd38dd2bfcf4e9b49c15","base_ref":null,"before":"5dc04eb6b1d1e36d5d12c179ba9a094356169a8f","commits":[{"author":{"email":"tonistiigi@gmail.com","name":"Tonis Tiigi","username":"tonistiigi"},"committer":{"email":"tonistiigi@gmail.com","name":"Tonis Tiigi","username":"tonistiigi"},"distinct":false,"id":"e39bdc13d97e899b07a0162f47964dc0da1968b8","message":"provenance: record request provenance for LLB refs\n\nKeep request provenance for solved refs by their LLB digest while the producing\nbuild is still active. Use the stored request when another solve later provides\nthe same LLB definition as a frontend input.\n\nThis lets max provenance report root and nested input requests for gateway and\nbuiltin Dockerfile frontend solves without accepting client-supplied request\nmetadata.\n\nSigned-off-by: Tonis Tiigi \u003ctonistiigi@gmail.com\u003e","timestamp":"2026-05-04T20:33:33-07:00","tree_id":"d32cc32f3c2a31dba624e072dff9dbf5abb880df","url":"https://github.com/moby/buildkit/commit/e39bdc13d97e899b07a0162f47964dc0da1968b8"},{"author":{"email":"tonistiigi@gmail.com","name":"Tonis Tiigi","username":"tonistiigi"},"committer":{"email":"tonistiigi@gmail.com","name":"Tonis Tiigi","username":"tonistiigi"},"distinct":false,"id":"d5323334111a6541b7e3cb0bdf34b5b2e5e88bec","message":"provenance: scrub nested min request inputs\n\nApply min provenance request scrubbing recursively to named inputs and root\nrequests so nested build args and labels do not leak into explicit min\nprovenance. Keep non-sensitive input request metadata and mark request\ncompleteness incomplete only when scrubbed args are omitted.\n\nSigned-off-by: Tonis Tiigi \u003ctonistiigi@gmail.com\u003e","timestamp":"2026-05-05T22:21:44-07:00","tree_id":"f626264bf2ce4f09943a5a1660c1bbaba043f2fe","url":"https://github.com/moby/buildkit/commit/d5323334111